    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d337-a1">

                <pb facs="0486" n="382" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg382"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of Cuba to the American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">President’s Office</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Minister</hi>: When we talked some time
                    ago about the subject matter of your note of today’s date you were unable to
                    explain why I should oppose the bill for the construction of the
                    Caibarién-Nuevitas railroad as now passed by Congress. The constitution requires
                    that when the President of the. Republic vetoes an act he shall return it to the
                    Congress with his reasons for not sanctioning it. I can find no ground whatever
                    for disapproving an act of Congress providing for a work, which is
                        regarded<anchor n="1" xml:id="d337-f1"/> as so beneficial to the country. I
                    regret, therefore, that I am not able to please you, and beg that you will so
                    inform the Department of State of the United States.</p>
                <p>Yours very truly,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">José M. Gómez</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
